      "Atomic queue cursor assigns each compacted (page,stripe) once; all 96 fetch threads share the claimed task via named barrier 14.",
      "Disjoint eight-token stripes and lane-strided vector enumeration assign every selected historical K and V uint4 to one thread.",
      "Each writer fences then joins the 96-thread barrier; leader acq_rel GPU add chains stripe completions. TMA waits with acquire for ready=8 and performs an async-proxy fence.",
